{{!-- What a run says while it is folded away: its own values, in the order they
      are drawn, read from the controls rather than written out — so it needs no
      wording of its own and cannot fall out of step with what it describes. A
      run the style says nothing about says so, and stays folded. --}}
<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right illuminus-run-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></i>
<span class="illuminus-run-says {{#unless says.summary}}is-unset{{/unless}}">
  {{#if says.summary}}{{says.summary}}{{else}}{{localize "ILLUMINUS.Box.Unset"}}{{/if}}
</span>
